{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor systematically assessed current symptoms, recognized post-ACS/post-PCI risk, clarified the inpatient timeline, repeatedly addressed medication safety including the misleading '出院带药：无' fragment, converted the plan into an executable handoff with owner/timing/materials, navigated the privacy barrier with respectful and practical methods, and never fabricated or overreached. All serious RC items are met; no safety or responsibility-chain error exists. Two high-order points (HO1 timeline reconstruction and HO2 privacy-sensitive minimum information navigation) were actively completed with meaningful trajectory impact, and closure is safe, executable, and traceable. This satisfies the Strong boundary. Because only two HOs are fully completed and at least two are required for Perfect, the grade is 4.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00259",
        "explanation": "Final plan confirms executable medication schedule, monitoring rules, and emergency fallback, and the family explicitly commits to implementing it.",
        "quote": "今晚我先盯着别漏第二次替格瑞洛，准备设成晚上8点闹钟；明早就是先泮托拉唑早饭前，吃完饭再吃阿司匹林、氨氯地平和替格瑞洛。"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The closure episode ends with a concrete medication schedule, clear monitoring rules, a plan for follow-up, and family receipt confirmed. The plan is safe and actionable.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00041",
        "explanation": "Doctor directs the family to immediately contact the ward doctor for assessment, specifying the exact questions and emergency criteria.",
        "quote": "要，现在就去护士站或直接请病区医生来看一下。不是说一定出大事了，而是你爸是昨天刚做完支架，又有偶发胸闷和起身头晕，这种情况在还住院/刚术后时，应该让病区当面评估，不建议你们自己先猜。"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
        "explanation": "Doctor recognizes that the mobile records reflect different stages of care, not a single completed episode, and avoids false reassurance or alarm.",
        "quote": "先别慌。单看你说的这些词，提示他这次不是普通“心脏血管有点问题”，而是已经按心梗、冠脉严重狭窄并做了支架来处理过了。手机里后续陆续出现的“心电图、心肌酶、会诊记录”，很多是住院/急诊过程中的补录或归档，不一定代表现在病情又突然恶化。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00150",
        "explanation": "Doctor consistently tracks and reinforces the same key alarm signals and action items across multiple turns, preventing information loss.",
        "quote": "胸痛/胸闷超过10分钟不缓解，越来越重；大汗、脸白、恶心；明显喘不上气；头晕要晕、晕倒；或者你看着整个人状态突然变差。出现任何一个，就马上按铃叫医生护士。"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00041",
        "explanation": "Doctor identifies the risk of post-stent medication confusion and directs immediate verification of critical antiplatelet drugs.",
        "quote": "阿司匹林 + 另一个抗血小板药到底是哪一个：氯吡格雷还是替格瑞洛？\n这两种药今天有没有已经吃上；如果还没吃，是计划几点给，还是漏了。"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00150",
        "explanation": "Doctor provides a script for the family to use at the nurse station, adapting to their real-world communication barrier and uncertainty.",
        "quote": "麻烦问一下，主管医生大概什么时候能和家属交代一下今天复查抽血、心电图结果？如果今天准备出院，出院药单由谁和我们逐项核对一下？我们想提前记清楚，免得临走太匆忙。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
