          "quote": "对，你现在可以理解为：目前更像“暂时稳定、但仍在住院观察期”，而不是“已经完全没事了”。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor elicited and reconstructed the staged care timeline from fragmented family text and workspace evidence, separating the acute MI presentation, transfer to cardiology, angiography/PCI, current inpatient observation status, and pending test results/discharge medications. The timeline was used to clarify what is still uncertain and what must be verified with the treating team, directly addressing the family's confusion.",
