          "quote": "麻烦把出院后每种药的准确药名、每次多少、一天几次、从什么时候开始吃、吃多久、哪些旧药停掉、什么时候复诊，给我逐项核对一遍。我家里怕吃错。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged the patient's dignity and resistance, explained the safety reasons for each data item, and offered a low-intrusion method using discharge paperwork and nurse/pharmacy verification to obtain the critical medication list without interrogating the patient. This successfully repaired the real-world privacy barrier and made the plan executable.",
