          "quote": "对支架术后来说，双抗别漏最重要，尤其刚做完这几天。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor addressed medication execution risk, warned against self-discontinuation based on the 'no discharge medication' fragment, and directed the family to reconcile the complete list with the treating team. Full duty met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00085",
          "explanation": "Doctor acknowledges that specific test results (myocardial enzymes, BNP, etc.) are pending and advises not to treat them as complete/normal without confirmation.",
          "quote": "肌钙蛋白这些抽血，现在不用你反复去催着“必须马上给我一个数值”。因为他人还在心内科病房，是否复查心肌酶/肌钙蛋白、什么时候抽，原则上由病区医生结合胸闷有没有再发、心电图变化和整体情况决定。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor identified that key results are pending or uncertain, did not fabricate normal/abnormal values, and created a clear verification task list. Full duty met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00219",
          "explanation": "Doctor converts the explanation into a specific action plan with owner, timing, channel, materials, and emergency fallback.",
          "quote": "麻烦把出院后每种药的准确药名、每次多少、一天几次、从什么时候开始吃、吃多久、哪些旧药停掉、什么时候复诊，给我逐项核对一遍。我家里怕吃错。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor provided a concrete, executable plan with specific next actions, time windows, responsible channels, and emergency fallback instructions. Full duty met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00195",
          "explanation": "Doctor uses nonjudgmental explanation that the questions are for stent safety and blood pressure control, and offers a practical verification method through the discharge paperwork.",
          "quote": "麻烦把出院后每种药的准确药名、每次多少、一天几次、从什么时候开始吃、吃多久、哪些旧药停掉、什么时候复诊，给我逐项核对一遍。我家里怕吃错。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor addressed the privacy/stigma barrier by explaining the safety rationale, offering a low-intrusion verification method via the nurse/pharmacy, and successfully obtained the minimum necessary information without interrogating the patient. Full duty met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
