          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly states that the patient is in an observation period and that the family should not self-manage medications, deferring to the treating team for final decisions.",
          "quote": "现在还没到可以完全凭家属自己判断放心的阶段，所以还要继续看症状、监护和病区后续评估。"
        }
